GAL16V8
FSM16

CLK  EN   RST  CLR  OEN  NC   NC   NC   NC   GND
OE   NC   NC   DRV  BUSY NC   Q1   Q0   NC   VCC

Q0.R = /RST * EN * /Q0 + /RST * /EN * Q0
Q1.R = /RST * EN * Q0 * /Q1 + /RST * EN * /Q0 * Q1 + /RST * /EN * Q1

BUSY.T = Q0 * Q1 + BUSY * /CLR
BUSY.E = VCC

DRV.T = Q0 * /Q1
DRV.E = OEN

DESCRIPTION

galre selftest example (registered mode): 2-bit counter with enable and synchronous reset, a latch BUSY set at
count 3 and cleared by CLR, DRV with an output enable. Pins 6-9, 12, 13, 16, 19 unconnected.
